{"language_code":"eng","language_probability":0.9508792161941528,"text":"End-to-end, one pass. Northwind emits behavioral windows, counts and rates per actor, never request bodies, never customer content. Hermes reads that stream continuously and when the shape stops looking like a person, publishes one incident onto the mesh. Five responders receive it and assess independently. Their assessments return by direct message to a coordinator that is not a model at all. It is plain Jack running fixed arithmetic. If that arithmetic clears the bar, containment is applied as Jack policy, scoped to one principle or one session, and written into the audit trail together with the action that reverses it. Detection, judgment, and enforcement are three separate things here on purpose.","words":[{"text":"End-to-end,","start":0.079,"end":0.919,"type":"word","logprob":-0.053106563712968964},{"text":" ","start":0.919,"end":1.179,"type":"spacing","logprob":-5.5549986427649856e-05},{"text":"one","start":1.179,"end":1.36,"type":"word","logprob":-5.5549986427649856e-05},{"text":" ","start":1.36,"end":1.48,"type":"spacing","logprob":-0.00023278864682652056},{"text":"pass.","start":1.48,"end":1.919,"type":"word","logprob":-0.0003596290829591453},{"text":" ","start":1.919,"end":2.459,"type":"spacing","logprob":-3.659658250398934e-05},{"text":"Northwind","start":2.46,"end":2.96,"type":"word","logprob":-0.06500232844781648},{"text":" ","start":2.96,"end":3.039,"type":"spacing","logprob":-0.00018034738604910672},{"text":"emits","start":3.039,"end":3.339,"type":"word","logprob":-0.00018034738604910672},{"text":" ","start":3.339,"end":3.419,"type":"spacing","logprob":-3.6954195820726454e-05},{"text":"behavioral","start":3.419,"end":4.019,"type":"word","logprob":-3.6954195820726454e-05},{"text":" ","start":4.019,"end":4.119,"type":"spacing","logprob":-0.0006313714548014104},{"text":"windows,","start":4.119,"end":4.599,"type":"word","logprob":-0.0006672554372926243},{"text":" ","start":4.599,"end